{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Vesper's Hunt",
    "steam_appid": 3615970,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615970/extras/desc_1.png?t=1753531086\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vampires are lurking among the mortals, and it\u2019s your job to uncover them before it's too late. Every turn, you\u2019ll gather clues, track movements, and use deduction to separate the innocent from the undead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unmask the Hidden Vampires</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615970/extras/desc_2.png?t=1753531086\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each round consists of two movement turns and one hunting turn\u2014but the vampire moves first. Watch their actions carefully, tag characters as suspects, confirmed threats, or mortals, and strike in your hunting turn!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Vampire Hunting Turn.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615970/extras/desc_3.png?t=1753531086\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each vampire must feed on a different mortal from the the same room they are. If there aren\u2019t enough mortals, excess vampires die. Per each room the vampire hunted, a mortal will become vampire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Detective Hunting Turn.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615970/extras/desc_4.png?t=1753531086\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The detective can use a mirror on his hunting turn to reveal the number of beasts\u2014not who!, vampires or werewolves, in the room. They will be aware they are under suspects and they will shift characters between rooms to cover their tracks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the Holy Water to strike the beasts to dust until you try on a mortal.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Turn-Based Deduction &amp; Strategy.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every turn is a battle of wits. You need to deduce if a vampire is moving to bluff you, cover their tracks or to disperse and and grow. Be careful, they are hunting you!.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solo or Multiplayer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play as a Vampire or as a Detective, solo against the machine or your friend. The demo only allows solo and Detective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615970/extras/desc_1.png?t=1753531086\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vampires are lurking among the mortals, and it\u2019s your job to uncover them before it's too late. Every turn, you\u2019ll gather clues, track movements, and use deduction to separate the innocent from the undead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unmask the Hidden Vampires</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615970/extras/desc_2.png?t=1753531086\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each round consists of two movement turns and one hunting turn\u2014but the vampire moves first. Watch their actions carefully, tag characters as suspects, confirmed threats, or mortals, and strike in your hunting turn!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Vampire Hunting Turn.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615970/extras/desc_3.png?t=1753531086\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each vampire must feed on a different mortal from the the same room they are. If there aren\u2019t enough mortals, excess vampires die. Per each room the vampire hunted, a mortal will become vampire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Detective Hunting Turn.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615970/extras/desc_4.png?t=1753531086\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The detective can use a mirror on his hunting turn to reveal the number of beasts\u2014not who!, vampires or werewolves, in the room. They will be aware they are under suspects and they will shift characters between rooms to cover their tracks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the Holy Water to strike the beasts to dust until you try on a mortal.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Turn-Based Deduction &amp; Strategy.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every turn is a battle of wits. You need to deduce if a vampire is moving to bluff you, cover their tracks or to disperse and and grow. Be careful, they are hunting you!.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solo or Multiplayer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play as a Vampire or as a Detective, solo against the machine or your friend. The demo only allows solo and Detective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "A turn-based deduction game where you play as a detective hunting vampires. Use a mirror to reveal hidden beasts and holy water to strike them down. But beware\u2014the undead grow stronger with every attack. Outsmart the vampires\u2026 or become their\u00a0next\u00a0victim!",
